   "text": "1. One working file, the register: goal, evidence and rules, never state.\n2. State is read from the runs; rdNN counts across the folder, not per item.\n3. A draft lives in results/<run>/content/, its picture in render/ beside it.\n4. Delivery reads a draft only after an independent Verify passed.",
   "originalText": "1. One working file, the register: goal, evidence and rules, never state.\n2. State is read from the runs; rdNN counts across the folder, not per item.\n3. A draft lives in results/<run>/content/, its picture in render/ beside it.\n4. Delivery reads a draft only after an independent Verify passed.",
