   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1790467200000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. A person releases the Commission; an agent runs only what is queued.\n2. Verify is a different agent in a fresh context, and it can fail a draft.\n3. A failed review becomes feedback on a new Generate; the old draft stays.\n4. An item's line says what it waits on: you or an agent, never a name.\n5. Runs panels fold, and Focus hides them, as in the Page Workbench.",
   "originalText": "1. A person releases the Commission; an agent runs only what is queued.\n2. Verify is a different agent in a fresh context, and it can fail a draft.\n3. A failed review becomes feedback on a new Generate; the old draft stays.\n4. An item's line says what it waits on: you or an agent, never a name.\n5. Runs panels fold, and Focus hides them, as in the Page Workbench.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
